  "method": "Three alternating-order Browse chains per transport (up to three pages), then one two-page Search chain per transport. Same production variables, browser-observed query IDs, 15s idle / 25s total timeouts. No retries. Reused cookie-free URLSession versus reused nonPersistent guest WKWebView with anonymous cookies and page-generated parameters.",
